
  Ubuntu dev box
  --------------
  claude        Claude Code (first run: /login, or set CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN / ANTHROPIC_API_KEY)
  codex         Codex CLI (first run: codex login --device-auth, or set OPENAI_API_KEY)
  cl / cx       the same, inside a detachable tmux session (tmux attach -t claude / codex)
  gh auth login GitHub CLI (or set GH_TOKEN)
  ~/            persisted on the volume (repos, logins, dotfiles survive redeploys)

